{"id":"lujo","lemma":"lujo","pos":"noun","rank":2151,"glosses":["luxury, extravagance (wealthy and comfortable surroundings)","luxury (something desirable but expensive)","luxury, treat, indulgence (something pleasant but not necessary)"],"ipa":"/ˈluxo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"lujos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-lujo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto es un lujo.","en":"This is a luxury.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443621","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Él llevó una vida de lujos.","en":"He led a life of luxury.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707322","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Él vive en el lujo.","en":"He lives in luxury.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to applaud","l":"vivar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ella solía vivir en el lujo.","en":"She used to live in luxury.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be accustomed to…","l":"soler"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Tomar un taxi es un lujo para mí.","en":"Taking a taxi is a luxury for me.","words":[{"g":"to take"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"taxi"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"in my opinion"]]}]}